/* English text for data/boole/ex-annales.js and data/boole/ex-td.js (merged over the French cards by id).
   Statements follow the English papers: B2 exam 2025-2026 (Moodle), the English finals and retakes of Past-Exams
   (Computer Architecture, S1 2016-2017 to 2023-2024), Tutorial_01.pdf and Chapter_1.pdf (NOT, AND, OR, NAND, NOR,
   XOR / EXCLUSIVE-OR, minterm / maxterm canonical form, Karnaugh map, circles, undefined (Φ), carry, iff…).
   Method: the French builders (window.BOOLE_K) already produced the HTML; here only the human text is replaced,
   text node by text node. Everything inside <span class="bx">, every tag and every tool option (data-opts) stays
   byte-identical, except the human “title” / “alt” values of the tools. Shared hint lists and notes are replaced as
   whole strings. window.BOOLE_EN.card(card) returns the English fields of one French card; data/en/boole/ex-td.js
   uses it for the Tutorial 1 cards. A text that is not in the tables below stays in French (node tools/check_i18n.js). */
