    "tr|Écrire ‘A = B’ = ~A.~B + A.B : juste, mais la consigne demande le OU exclusif quand c’est possible.": "Writing ‘A = B’ = ~A.~B + A.B: correct, but the instructions ask for the EXCLUSIVE-OR when possible.",
